All systems run in Codex CLI as the coding-agent harness with \modelGenBare\ as the generator; API-based scoring uses \modelJudgeBare\ as the primary evaluator.\footnote{We choose Luna for high-volume long-form generation because OpenAI positions it for fast, cost-sensitive workloads, and Sol as the primary evaluator because it is the higher-capability tier for complex professional work.
Assigning the higher-capability tier to evaluation keeps generation scalable; the shared model family motivates the cross-family check~\citep{openai2026luna,openai2026sol,openai2026gpt56}.}
